cable\nL514@P17: and appropriate concerning LNG issues.\nL515@P17: For commercial consulting and lobbying Services identified in Schedule 1, Client will pay\nL516@P17: Consultant the following fees in U.S. Dollars ($), per the following terms:\nL517@P17: $40,000 per month during the Term, as set forth in Section 2 ofthe Agreement. Consultant will\nL518@P17: invoice Client for all fees and expenses quarterly, and Client will pay said fees and expenses\nL519@P17: quarterly, in advance, with the first fee payment of $ 120,000 due and payable on February 1, 2025,\nL520@P17: and additional payment of a fee of $120,000, plus all expenses, due August 1, 2025, and identical\nL521@P17: quarterly payments of fees and expenses for any Extended Term. All payments of fees and\nL522@P17: expenses are net to Consultant, free of and excluding any value-added tax (VAT) or similar tax or\nL523@P17: withholding.\nL524@P17: Confidential - Not for Public Consumption or Distribution\nL525@P17-18: Received by NSD/FARA Registration Unit 05/06/2025 9:48:54 AMReceived by NSD/FARA Registration Unit 05/06/2025 9:48:54 AM\nL526@P18: SCHEDULE 3\nL527@P18: Contact Information\nL528@P18: Ifto Consultant:\nL529@P18: Ifto Client:\nL530@P18: For invoices\nL531@P18: PRVO PLINARSKO DRUSTVO d.o.o. (PPD Group) DC contract clean V2 02012025 MS.docx\nL532@P18: Client will pay and reimburse Consultant for all reasonable business expenses paid or incurred in\nL533@P18: providing the Services, said expenses to be invoiced quarterly along with fees. Reimbursement for\nL534@P18: any individual expense greater than $500.00 shall require the prior written consent ofClient.\nL535@P18: Mercury Public Affairs LLC\nL536@P18: 10006 Cross Creek Blvd. Suite 409\nL537@P18: Tampa, FL 33647\nL538@P18: United State ofAmerica\nL539@P18: Telephone: 813-908-1380\nL540@P18: Email: DASAccounting@mercuryllc.com\nL541@P18: PRVO PLINARSKO DRUSTVO d.o.o.\nL542@P18: Attn: Pavao Vujnovac\nL543@P18: Email: pavao.vujnovac@ppd.hr\nL544@P